Package: hovernet-editor
Version: 0.0.0
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: HoverNet Team <devteam@outiva.com>
Depends: hovernet-game, libc6, libstdc++6, libsdl2-2.0-0
Description: HoverNet track editor
 Make and edit HoverNet tracks: build a road room by room, check it with the real
 compiler and validator, and race on it in the game. Needs the hovernet-game
 package (the game, its object plug-in and the fonts).
